  <Speakers>
    <Section>Speaker</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45312,45436,45560,45716,45836</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>アルベルト</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Albert</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45904</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Mel&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mel&gt;</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45996</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>エトス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ethos</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45316</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_053_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>声を聞いただけで、ルナ様の美しさはわかっただ。
戦わねーとわかって、覗いて見たおらは勝ち組だーよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I knew Luna'd be a real beauty just from her voice. Gettin' a
good look without even fightin'... I'm the real winner here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45440</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_053_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いやー、この世界には、こったらべっぴんさんが
多いの多くねーのって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There sure are a lot of real 
gorgeous women in this world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45564</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_053_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ましてや精霊様だなんて神秘的過ぎて、
おらもう興奮のるつぼだーよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And she's one of them spirits, too! She's got so much
*mystique*. Ohh, I'm gettin' so excited, I can't hardly stand it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45720</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_053_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>問題はあの、アルテなんちゃらってちっこいヤツだ。
あれはエト助に任せて、その間におらがルナ様に……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Only problem is, that tiny Artie-whatsit fella. I'll have to leave
that to Ethos, and then I'll make my move on Lady Luna...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45840</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_053_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ぐふ……、ぐふふ……、ぐふふふ……。
ふふふ…………………、ふぅ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ahuh... Ahuhuhuh... Ahuhuhuhuhuh...
Huhuhuhuhuh.... Haaaauuuh.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>45908</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_053_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どうしたのエト？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's up, Ethos?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>46000</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_002_053_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>う……ううん……なんか寒気がしたかラ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>N-Nothing.. I just,
felt this sudden chill...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Notice</Section>
  </Strings>
</SceneText>
